<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · 结交、融洽、偶遇与拜访 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Getting along, Running into & Dropping by</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>23 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>遵循 EPE Ch.5 图式：两人并排顺畅同行即相处融洽（get along）；两条轨迹意外相交碰撞即偶遇（run/bump into, come across）；顺路擦身停靠即顺道拜访（drop by/in）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>8/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>visit for entertainment</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>visit, see</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Take</b> <b>in</b> the sights.</div></div></div></td></tr>
