<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>ask <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [request] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make a date</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>request, bespeak</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Has he <b>asked</b> you <b>out</b> yet?</div></div></div></td></tr>
