<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 支持、依赖、照料与替补 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Backing up, Counting on & Looking after</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>22 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>站在某人身旁或身后提供支撑即力挺（stand by / back up），将自身重量放心地压在基座上即依赖指望（count/rely/depend on）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>1/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: arise)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>rise to one's feet</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>arise, rise</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The audience got up and applauded.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>help <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: help)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be of help, as in a particular situation of need</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>help, assist</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Can you <b>help</b> <b>out</b> tonight with the dinner guests?</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: typify)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>express indirectly by an image, form, or model; be a symbol</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>typify, symbolize</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>What does the Statue of Liberty symbolize?</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [refrain] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>not act or do anything</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>refrain, forbear</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He just stood by when the police beat up the demonstrators.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: jump)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be highly noticeable</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>jump, appear</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>stand</b> <b>out</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>wait <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [serve] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>work for or be a servant to</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>serve, attend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>May I serve you?</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She attends the old lady in the wheelchair.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Can you <b>wait</b> <b>on</b> our table, please?</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: mean)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>denote or connote</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>mean, intend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>`maison' means `house' in French.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>An example sentence would show what this word means.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: stay)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>stay clear of, avoid</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>stay</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Keep your hands off my wife!</div></div>
