<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [substitute] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be a substitute</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>substitute, sub</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The young teacher had to substitute for the sick colleague.</div></div>
