<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: stick)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be loyal to</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>stick, adhere</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She stood by her husband in times of trouble.</div></div>
