<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>5/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: bristle)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>rise up as in fear</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>bristle, uprise</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The dog's fur bristled.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>It was a sight to make one's hair uprise!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>fill <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>1/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [complete] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>write all the required information onto a form</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>complete</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span><b>Fill</b> <b>out</b> this questionnaire, please!</div></div>
