<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 背叛、抛弃、排挤与出卖 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Selling out, Turning on & Shutting out</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>25 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>把同伴关在圈子门外即排挤（shut/leave out），突然调转矛头扑向同伴即反咬背叛（turn on），彻底走出关系即抛弃（walk out on）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>1/10</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [forfeit] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>lose (s.th.) or lose the right to (s.th.) by some error, offense, or crime</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>forfeit, waive</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>You've forfeited your right to name your successor.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Forfeited property.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 11 个核心义项'>9/11</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [ensnare] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take or catch as if in a snare or trap</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>ensnare, entrap</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I was <b>set</b> <b>up</b>!</div></div>
